    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐλή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worm, maggot</i>, the larva of
			the fly (rarely in sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.472.10
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>)), different fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμινς</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, of worms bred in flesh, <i><span class="en">
				19.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.414
			</span></i>, al.; 
